    "state": "completed",
    "question": "Using the reviewed Massachusetts transit, population and Boston Logan weather annual context dataset, show a comparison table for 2022 through 2025 with report year, reported passenger trips, questionable trip record count, July 1 population, Logan average temperature in Celsius and precipitation in millimetres. Explain the reporting-period, geography and quality limitations. Do not infer causality."
